{"unit_id": "STARDUSTLC666__dsh-voice#feature-1", "repo": "STARDUSTLC666/dsh-voice", "commit": "cb694baf007cc67ab5e430ba7ac37e2ffe4944f4", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-voice 的功能「语音合成」：将不超过 5000 字符的文字合成为 MP3，可指定音色、语速、音调和输出路径；未指定时保存为工作区中的默认文件名。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/tools.js:167-205"]}
